=== layout: prompt

# Breakout Room Chat

@prompt

What small decision would you refuse to let a robot make for you?

@examples

Introduce yourself and name one decision. Would you let a robot name your pet, pick your birthday cake, or answer texts from your family? Tell your group why you would keep that decision.

